cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it."
type: software

title: "From Entry to Exit: An Open-Source Toolkit for Detecting Corner Events in Race Car Telemetry"

abstract: >-
  Python implementation of a data-driven algorithm for the
  standardized identification of racing trajectory landmarks
  from vehicle telemetry data. The algorithm identifies turn
  entry, turn exit, clipping point, and maximum-curvature point.

